    "body": "@anki-code Your latest comment on #1265 (https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/1265#issuecomment-792051461) brought back this issue to my attention and after reading again https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/272#issuecomment-695213222 (and going through linked PRs) I decided it is time to try it again locally. So here is what I did:\r\n\r\n1. Created a virtual environment using `venv`\r\n2. Installed `xonsh` inside it using:\r\n\t```\r\n\tpip install xonsh[full]\r\n\t```\r\n\tas suggested in [xonsh docs](https://xon.sh/packages.html#package-manager:~:text=pip%3A%20Typically%20you%20will%20activate%20a,pip%20install%20pygments%20prompt%2Dtoolkit%20setproctitle%20xonsh)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Failed Termux attempts</summary>\r\n\r\nAnd here is the result:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/110304052-6bfa0b80-7ffb-11eb-9cdb-4fc21c08d170.png)\r\n\r\nThis doesn't look right :upside_down_face: \r\n\r\nSo I thought maybe it will work if I remove `prompt-toolkit`, did that, and got the same thing even with `readline` backend:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/110304489-f478ac00-7ffb-11eb-8427-333d9777a056.png)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nThen I took a step back and decided to try on a real Linux machine instead of my pocket Termux toy and finally here it is:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/110305919-87661600-7ffd-11eb-8a4c-0de2755d629d.png)\r\n\r\nOnce again, tried without `prompt-toolkit` using `readline` backend:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1170440/110306176-d01dcf00-7ffd-11eb-9686-4a74fc14a157.png)\r\n\r\nAnd it works! :tada:\r\n\r\nSo thank you @anki-code for bringing this back to my attention and sorry about the delay, I'm reopening #1265 now and removing the upstream label.",
